DESCRIPTION >
    Materializes hourly Home KPI aggregates from `telemetry_events_ch`
    into `home_kpi_hourly` (AggregatingMergeTree). Runs as an insert
    trigger on every block written to `telemetry_events_ch`, so it only
    covers rows ingested after this pipe is deployed — existing history
    is not backfilled. `ClickHouseSink.query_home_kpis` falls back to a
    live scan of `telemetry_events_ch` while a tenant/hour has no rollup
    row yet (see `home_kpi_hourly.datasource`).

NODE home_kpi_hourly_mv_q
SQL >
    SELECT
        tenant_id,
        toStartOfHour(timestamp) AS hour,
        countState() AS event_count,
        sumState(toUInt64(outcome = 'error')) AS error_count,
        avgState(toFloat64(duration_ms)) AS avg_duration_state,
        quantileState(0.95)(toFloat64(duration_ms)) AS p95_duration_state
    FROM telemetry_events_ch
    GROUP BY tenant_id, hour

TYPE MATERIALIZED
DATASOURCE home_kpi_hourly
